  <item>
    <title>EP119. 和教练Léo漫谈Padel板式网球 为什么AI认为它是全球增长最快的新兴运动...</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6766937e1e823e72d39a1397</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6766937e1e823e72d39a1397</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Dec 2024 10:16:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>丨本期嘉宾丨</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnNAfg2ne2-E56M_AlorUP8s9eQl.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎾Padel π 发起人：Léo</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>丨本期剧透丨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2024年12月18日午后，我和Léo相约来到了内容中苔的播客录音间，和他畅聊Padel板式网球的起源以及Padel板式网球在中国的发展历程，Léo分享了自己从羽毛球转Padel的心路历程，是如何沉迷入坑打Padel，夜晚比完赛都会接着打球到凌晨的经历。目前Léo自己考取了Padel的教练证，希望能够帮助更多对Padel感兴趣的新人入门。同时，还在健身房刻苦练习，祝他将来在竞技对抗比赛中取得成绩的突破。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>丨内容提要丨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> 和Léo初识于今天三月的Padel场地促销活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> Padel板式网球的发展历程和国际流行趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 网球与Padel运动的渊源与差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> Padel的全球与中国发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> Léo认为Padel运动吸引他的特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> 冬天也会消退Padel新人的热情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1377">22:57</a> 在教学Padel新人入门时会遇到的状况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> 探讨Padel运动的两种推广路径与价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a> Padel新人如何更有参与感地比赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a> Padel也有国家队和世界杯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">47:30</a> Padel板式网球的场地魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3101">51:41</a> Padel国际巡回赛中的知名选手和观看方式</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>丨Léo的小红书丨</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg3MIeAXy5N2eE0nUHOjlg4rJDNx.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>你可以关注小红书@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ebc90600000000001006886?xsec_token=YBxf3lndekfTJDD6bQQLYPGNEtnrIPlGtMRVWzh-nIToY=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5481a9a3d6e4a96901ed5dfc&amp;apptime=1734775441&amp;share_id=0c7d48e4182d4fef9619906e4e53663d" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ebc90600000000001006886?xsec_token=YBxf3lndekfTJDD6bQQLYPGNEtnrIPlGtMRVWzh-nIToY=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5481a9a3d6e4a96901ed5dfc&amp;apptime=1734775441&amp;share_id=0c7d48e4182d4fef9619906e4e53663d"><span>Léo</span></a><span> 了解更多Léo的Padel相关动态</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>丨本期音乐丨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>结尾：古老的法兰西歌曲-柴可夫斯基</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢内容中苔提供的播客录音室支持！</span></p>]]></description>
